<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Still settling in, dear?\rHave a look around town when\nyou’re ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\nthe Pokégear!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokémon Gear...\nor Pokégear, as it’s often called,\fis what every Trainer should have.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Guess what?\nYou can use the Pokégear to make a\fphone call, too.\fDo you remember how? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just power on the Pokégear and\ntouch the telephone button, OK?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Select the POKéGEAR button on the\nTouch Screen. Then select the\ftelephone button.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The names of the people you can call\nare automatically registered.\rJust select one to give him or her\na call.\rWow, I can’t believe it’s so easy\nto make a phone call!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Off out again?\rRoute 30 runs north out of town.\nTake care of yourself, dear.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\nSo, you’re leaving on an adventure...\rOK! I’ll help, too.\nBut what can I do for you?\rI know!\nEvery time you receive prize money,\fI’ll save some of it for you.\rOn a long journey, money’s important.\rDo you want me to save\nyour money for you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I want to support you on your\nadventure, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\fOK! I’ll help, too.\fBut what can I do for you?\rI know!\rEvery time you receive prize money,\nI’ll save some of it for you.\rOn a long journey, money’s important.\nDo you want me to save\fyour money for you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK, I’ll take care of your money.\rBe careful.\rPokémon are your friends.\nWhen you work as a team,\fyou can accomplish anything!\fNow, go on!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK, but be careful out there.\rPokémon are your friends.\nWhen you work as a team,\fyou can accomplish anything!\fNow, go on!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, stand firm!\nI’m always there for you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi! Welcome home!\nYou’re doing fine, I see.\rI’ve kept your room tidy and clean.\nOr...\fIs this about your money? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just do what you can.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nYou have no money saved.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your money’s safe here!\nTake care of yourself!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\nYou should think hard how you spend it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Do you want to save some money? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nYou have no money left to save.\rDon’t waste your money on\nfrivolous things, OK?\rI know you are sensible like me\nand that I can count on you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I have saved so much.\nI can’t save any more.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You have so much money already.\nI can’t let you have any more.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WITHDRAW</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DEPOSIT MONEY</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CHANGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EXIT</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Oh good, you’re up!\rCome here a moment - I’ve got a\nfew things for you before you\fhead out.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You should visit Professor Elm’s\ninstitute in New Bark sometime.\fHe always asks after you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The TV is not set up yet.\nIts cables are still coiled\nin a box beside it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A tower of taped-up moving\nboxes, every one labelled\nin neat marker.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The sink gleams already -\nMom scrubbed it before a\nbox was even unpacked.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The fridge is nearly bare -\njust water and lemonade.\nWe only got here today.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">......\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: ...Honey. Hey - we’re here.\rWake up, sleepyhead.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: We made it. Our new home!\rI still can’t believe we actually\ndid it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: All the way from Kalos... and now\nthis is home.\rA whole new region. A fresh start, for\nboth of us.\rThe movers got everything here in one\npiece. More or less.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Go on up and see your new room -\nI had them set your things up first.\rYour PC should be working. Sort it out\nwhile I unpack down here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: There you are! All settled in?\nBefore you head out, let me set you up\nproperly.\fBe sure to make sure your bag is packed before you go. It’s always important to be prepared for anything!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Oh, this came for you!\fYour very own Pokégear. It has a map, phone,\nradio, and clock, all in one.\nBe sure to call me every day, sweetie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Aww, it’s so cute that you’re already making friends in town. Have fun playing Pokemons. Just be home before dark!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MOM: Hold on - you’re not rushing off\nbare-handed!\rGo on up and set up your PC, or come\nsay a proper goodbye and I’ll send you\noff with your Pokégear.\rIt only takes a minute, promise.</language>
	</row>
</body>
